  mapFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: e23cc1bbbf678ea44b2657a046f94825, type: 3}
  id: base.quest.12
  number: 12
  title: "Barak Tor\u2014Barrow of the Witch Lord"
  previousQuest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b91a7f8752563345b606c18bb1ff3a3, type: 2}
  parchmentText: War with the eastern orcs is brewing and the King needs to unite
    the lands for the conflict to come. To do this, you must find the ancient Star
    of the West as worn by the Rulers of Legend in ages past. A reward of 200 gold
    coins is offered (to be divided evenly among all heroes) when the Star of the
    West is returned to safety. The Star of the West lies in Barak Tor, the resting
    place of the evil Witch Lord. He was defeated by the magical Spirit Blade long
    ago. This blade is the only weapon that could harm him.
  zargonNote: 
