    cell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    description: This is the tomb of the Witch Lord. The Witch Lord is released from
      his imprisonment when the first hero enters the room. Use the Dread sorcerer
      figure to represent the Witch Lord on the board. Read the text that follows
      to the players.
    requiresDeadGroup: 
