  - key: The Witch Lord
    trigger: 0
    roomId: 
    cell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    description: 'The Witch Lord is not affected by any weapon or spell. Only the
      Spirit Blade can harm him. The heroes must try to recover the Spirit Blade
      in the next quest. The Witch Lord moves 1 space per turn and rolls 2 Attack
      dice. He also knows the following spells: summon undead, fear, command, and
      ball of flame. (Refer to the Dread spell cards for details.)'
